OL,3,GNEWSARapist and grooming gang members
OL,4,Awho preyed on children jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men and a woman who preyed on
OL,7,Fteenage girls in north Wales have been
OL,8,Fjailed for their roles in a grooming
OL,9,Fgang.
OL,11,FThe victims of the group were aged 14,
OL,12,F15 and 16 at the time of the abuse in
OL,13,Fthe seaside town of Rhyl, Denbighshire.
OL,15,FThe ringleader of the gang Mustafa
OL,16,FIqbal was jailed for 35 years after
OL,17,Fbeing convicted of 21 offences,
OL,18,Fincluding four rapes and three of
OL,19,Fsexual assault involving all three of
OL,20,Fthe girls.
